# pop'n music 9 (Konami Python 1): boot -> title -> 2 coins (one credit) -> the red
# button starts. Checks the interface board's inputs through the HIRAKU core.
game popn9

at 3200 press "Coin 1" 8
at 3240 press "Coin 1" 8
at 3300 snap
at 3400 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 3500 snap
at 3800 snap
at 4100 snap
at 4400 snap
at 4500 quit
